<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="page-head">
  <h1>What makes good advice?</h1>
  <p class="lead">Lots of people will give you advice about high school. Every tip on this site had to pass all three of these tests. If it failed even one, it didn't make the list.</p>
</div>

<ol class="tests">
  <li><h2 class="h3">It's realistic</h2><p>You can actually do it. "Study 5 hours a night" fails. "Study 20 minutes a night" passes.</p></li>
  <li><h2 class="h3">It really happened</h2><p>It comes from something I or a friend went through, not something that just sounds smart.</p></li>
  <li><h2 class="h3">It points to a better choice</h2><p>It tells you what to do instead, not just what went wrong.</p></li>
</ol>

<section class="compare">
  <h2>Making advice better</h2>
  <div class="compare-grid">
    <div class="weak">
      <p class="compare-label">Weak</p>
      <p class="quote">"Be organized."</p>
      <p>True, but how? It doesn't say what to do.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="better">
      <p class="compare-label">Better</p>
      <p class="quote">"Give each class its own folder, so you never lose a handout the day before it's due."</p>
      <p>It's specific, it comes from a real problem, and it tells you exactly what to do.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
